<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/inspection-clipboard.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/inspection-clipboard-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/inspection-clipboard.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.1"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">Specialties</span></nav><p class="tag">What we do</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Services Across the Islands</h1><p class="lede">Every Hawaii Insurance Appraiser specialty is built around one deliverable: an accurate, defensible valuation of your loss — from a single estimate review to full panel representation or neutral umpire work.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn sun" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line-light" href="/contact-hawaii-appraiser/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="ilist" data-stagger><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-specialties/appraisal-clause-representation/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="960" height="641" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Specialty 01</small><h2>Appraisal Clause Representation</h2><p>Your appointed appraiser once either side invokes the appraisal provision in your Hawaii property policy.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-specialties/homeowner-claim-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/oahu-suburb.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/oahu-suburb-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/oahu-suburb.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Specialty 02</small><h2>Homeowner Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal support for single-family homes, ohana units and plantation-style houses when the claim number falls short.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-specialties/condo-aoao-commercial-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/condo-towers.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/condo-towers-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/condo-towers.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="645" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Specialty 03</small><h2>Condo, AOAO &amp; Commercial</h2><p>Appraisal for AOAO master-policy claims, HOA communities, unit owners and commercial buildings across the islands.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-specialties/roof-hail-claim-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/metal-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/metal-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/metal-roof.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Specialty 04</small><h2>Roof &amp; Hail Claims</h2><p>Roof claim appraisal for metal, shingle and tile roofs damaged by wind, wind-driven rain or rare Hawaii hail.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-specialties/kona-storm-high-wind-claims/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fallen-tree.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fallen-tree-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fallen-tree.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="797" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Specialty 05</small><h2>Kona Storm &amp; High-Wind Claims</h2><p>Appraisal for Kona low, trade-wind and downslope gust damage, plus rare waterspout or tornado losses on the islands.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-specialties/hurricane-claim-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hurricane-satellite.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hurricane-satellite-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hurricane-satellite.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Specialty 06</small><h2>Hurricane Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Hurricane claim appraisal for Hawaii homes and buildings, including deductible math, roof loss and wind-driven rain.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-specialties/water-damage-claim-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/flood-street.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/flood-street-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/flood-street.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="751" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Specialty 07</small><h2>Water Damage Claims</h2><p>Appraisal for plumbing leaks, condo stack pipe failures and wind-driven rain damage in Hawaii homes and units.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-specialties/fire-smoke-claim-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fire-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fire-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fire-damage.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="798" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Specialty 08</small><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Claims</h2><p>Appraisal for structure fires, kitchen fires and smoke or soot damage to Hawaii homes, condos and businesses.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-specialties/wildfire-claim-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wildfire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wildfire.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Specialty 09</small><h2>Wildfire Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for Hawaii wildfire losses – total losses, smoke and ash, debris removal, ALE and rising rebuild costs.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-specialties/volcanic-ashfall-lava-claims/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/lava-flow.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/lava-flow-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/lava-flow.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Specialty 10</small><h2>Volcanic, Ash &amp; Lava Claims</h2><p>Appraisal for volcanic ash, vog corrosion and lava losses on the Big Island, including HPIA-insured homes.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-specialties/carrier-estimate-review/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Specialty 11</small><h2>Carrier Estimate Review</h2><p>A line-by-line review of your insurer’s estimate to find missing scope, low pricing, GET and freight errors.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-specialties/umpire-services/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-documents.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-documents-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-documents.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Specialty 12</small><h2>Umpire Services</h2><p>Neutral umpire services for property insurance appraisals on every Hawaiian island, for homes, condos and businesses.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap split top"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most files begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone invokes appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A review answers that in days, and some disputes close at that stage with a documented supplement.</p><a class="btn" href="/appraisal-specialties/carrier-estimate-review/">About carrier estimate reviews <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one part of the process?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Many owners start with an estimate review and decide later whether to invoke appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle condo associations and commercial buildings?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="a"><p>Yes — single-family homes, condos and AOAOs, townhouse communities, retail, office, hospitality and mixed-use buildings.</p></div></details><details><summary>Which perils do you work on?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="a"><p>Hurricane, Kona-storm wind, roof leaks and rare hail, water, fire and smoke, wildfire and volcanic or ash-related losses, among others.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="band"><div class="wrap band-in rv"><div><h2>Not sure the settlement is right?</h2><p>Send us the carrier’s estimate. We’ll review it and tell you what we see — no obligation.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn sun" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line-light" href="/contact-hawaii-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
